  "solution": "**Given:**\n\na2 + b2 + 49*c*2 + 18 = 2 (b - 28c - a)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\na2 + b2 + 49*c*2 + 18 = 2 (b - 28c - a)\n\n⇒ a2 + b2 + 49*c*2 + 18 = 2b - 56c - 2a\n\n⇒ a2 + b2 + 49*c*2 + 18 - 2b + 56c + 2a = 0\n\n⇒ a2 + 2a + 1 + b2 - 2b + 1 + 49*c*2 + 56c + 16 = 0\n\n⇒ (a + 1)² + (b - 1)² + (7c + 4)² = 0\n\nNow the above equation is 0, only when\n\n⇒ a + 1 = 0, b - 1 = 0, 7c + 4 = 0\n\n⇒ a = - 1, b = 1, c = - 4/7\n\nThen, (a + b - 7c) = (- 1) + 1 - [7 × (- 4/7)]\n\n= - 1 + 1 + 4\n\n= 4\n\n**∴ The value of (a + b - 7c) is 4**",
